WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.260 --> 00:00:07.650
From an approved request, create the purchase order, choose the supplier and send it.

2
00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:11.100
Approved requests wait in Approved, to order.

3
00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:14.520
Open the request.

4
00:00:14.520 --> 00:00:19.960
Its approval history is here. The next step is the purchase order.

5
00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:26.080
Choose Create the purchase order. The lines come from the request.

6
00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:30.660
Choose the supplier, or type a new one.

7
00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:37.600
Check the delivery date and the payment terms. Late deliveries are flagged on the purchasing page.

8
00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:40.940
Put the price the supplier quoted.

9
00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:49.210
Save and mark as sent. The order has its number and is ready to print or email.

10
00:00:49.210 --> 00:00:53.500
This table follows each line: ordered, received and billed.
